# Home

Import Layout.

## Page /

Head:
    <title>Home — Acme</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Acme's home page.">

View:
    {extends Site}
    {block content:}
      <h1 id="title">Home</h1>
      <p id="body">Welcome to Acme.</p>
    {end}

## Test: the layout wraps the page and marks Home active

Expect that the text of "#title" is equal to "Home".
Expect that the count of "nav a.active" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "nav a.active" is equal to "Home".
Expect that the text of "footer" is equal to "© Acme".
